{"title":"TATA 1mg - India's Leading Healthcare Platform","text":"Get Second Opinion\nNew\nFind Cancer Specialists\nBuy Cancer Medicines\nBook Tests for Cancer\nGet Financial Support\nAccess NGOs\nAccess to quality cancer care does not occur by chance\nTata 1mg is here to support you and provide access to quality cancer care.\n\nNEW\n\nGet Second Opinion: Tata Memorial Centre\n\nFind cancer specialists\n\nBuy Cancer Medicines\n\nGet Financial Support\n\nBook Tests for Cancer\n\nExplore Patient Support Programs\n\nAccess Cancer Care NGOs\n\nMajor Types of Cancer\nBreast\nCancer\nAbout\nSupport Programs\nNGOs\nBlood\nCancer\nAbout\nSupport Programs\nNGOs\nColon\nCancer\nAbout\nSupport Programs\nNGOs\nProstate\nCancer\nAbout\nSupport Programs\nNGOs\nLung\nCancer\nAbout\nSupport Programs\nNGOs\nMultiple\nMyeloma\nAbout\nSupport Programs\nNGOs\nKidney\nCancer\nAbout\nSupport Programs\nNGOs\nCervical\nCancer\nAbout\nSupport Programs\nNGOs\nWhat Causes Cancer\n\nCancer comprises a complex group of diseases with many possible causes. While genetics play a major role in cancer, other causes of cancer can differ between children and adults.\n\nChildhood Cancers\n\nA mutation or cell change that just happened by chance is a common cause for cancer in children.\n\nAdult Cancers\n\nIn addition to mutations, lifestyle factors like smoking, tobacco, an unhealthy diet, lack of physical activity, working with toxic chemicals, or exposure to certain viruses may put adults at risk for cancers.\n\nDid you KNOW?\n\nOnly one out of four patients who have been prescribed cancer medicines actually starts the treatment.\n\nOut-of-pocket expenditure for cancer is one of the highest for any ailment. With Tata 1mg, you can reduce this expense by getting up to 20% OFF on your medicines.\n\nGet Here\nCANCER IN\nIndia\n2,250,000+\npeople are living with cancer\n1,150,000+\npeople are diagnosed with cancer every year\n12%\nincrease in cancer cases estimated between 2020-2025\nWe strongly believe that awareness is the key to manage cancer better.\nAre you overwhelmed by information on the internet?\nTrust only evidence driven medical information reviewed by experts\nCancer symptoms & tests, common myths debunked\nCOVID and cancer: Is the risk higher?\nWhat does breast cancer feel like?\nHow can cancer be treated?\nWalking can help people with advanced cancer\nBreast cancer screening tests\n5 causes and risk factors Of prostate cancer\nOvarian cancer: Know everything\nWhy choose Tata 1mg?\nA pocketful of trust\nQuality care at reduced cost\n\nWe help reduce medicine, diagnostic, and consultation expenses through inexhaustible discounts and coupon codes. You can save up to 20% on medicines. Get access to exclusive membership of pharma-run campaigns.\n\nDoorstep Services\n\nSupporting caregivers through doorstep delivery of medicines, collection of test samples, online reports, online consultations and more.\n\nExpert-vetted, evidence-driven information\n\nOur team consists of medical experts, qualified doctors, pharmacists, and editors who have extensive experience and expertise in scientific research and medical writing. The medicine and health content that we publish is curated through a well-structured editorial and review process which includes an in-depth review by our Clinical Specialist Review Board.\n\nIn-app pill reminder\n\nGiven how crucial on-time medicine administration is, Tata 1mg pill reminder keeps track of when and what medicines need to be taken, so you never miss a dose.\n\nHealth Records\n\nThis in-app feature helps everyone — cancer patients as well as their caregivers — keep a log of their liver and kidney health, sugar levels, BP, and other parameters.\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and Conditions\nEditorial Policy\nIP Policy\nGrievance Redressal Policy\nAll the information provided here is for informational and awareness purposes only. It should NOT be used as a substitute for the advice of a qualified physician. Please consult your doctor and discuss all your queries related to any disease or medicine.\nTata 1mg's sole intention is to support our consumers throughout their cancer journey, one step at a time. We have made all efforts to keep the information true to the best of our knowledge. However, this may not cover everything about particular health conditions, medicines, all ongoing patient support or access programs, eligibility criteria, alerts, etc. We are continuously working on updates, improvisations, and advancements.\nCopyright\n1800-102-1618","images":[{"src":"https://assets.1mg.com/pwa-app/production/dweb/2.0.3/static/images/svgs/icons/chevron-up_18px_primary.svg","alt":"Back to top","w":19,"h":18},{"src":"https://www.1mg.com/images/tata_1mg_logo.svg","alt":"1mg logo","w":124,"h":42},{"src":"https://marketing-compaigns.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/emailer/Landing_pages_2022/Cancer_microsite/home/Images/tata_1mg.svg","alt":"1mg logo","w":300,"h":66},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/9acd572e-e815-4232-9152-9cf0f6664713.png","alt":"hamburger","w":30,"h":30},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/51e49cc6-37f8-4f10-9271-34981a3b46da.svg","alt":"TATA","w":55,"h":48},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/3667e9cc-6102-4022-afd3-8c6dc5ed9ea0.png","alt":"Conquer Cancer with Hope & Care","w":2560,"h":784},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/308ebd83-c1f8-499b-accf-fc9c9e73ef2c.svg","alt":"Navya care logo","w":105,"h":104},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/ff1111e4-3cb5-4f9c-ab19-7353e4076ceb.svg","alt":"Find cancer specialists","w":105,"h":104},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/592c21f5-b62c-44a1-adda-acbfaff44292.svg","alt":"Buy Cancer Medicines","w":105,"h":104},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/fe623d02-d64e-41be-b054-61a79b3f7d0b.svg","alt":"Get Financial Support","w":104,"h":104},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/e424a497-1d07-47fe-a5b9-688d728bf5d0.svg","alt":"Book Tests for Cancer","w":105,"h":104},{"src":"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/b50e6720-4d2e-43